# Optional deployment overrides.
#
# GitHub Actions already derives both values from `GITHUB_REPOSITORY`, so a
# standard GitHub Pages deployment needs neither of these variables set.
# Copy this file to `.env` only when you build locally with a custom domain,
# or when you want to test the production URL layout.
#
# User page      (https://<user>.github.io):       SITE_URL=https://<user>.github.io
# Project page   (https://<user>.github.io/repo):  SITE_URL=https://<user>.github.io
#                                                  BASE_PATH=/repo
# Custom domain  (https://blog.example.com):       SITE_URL=https://blog.example.com
#
# SITE_URL=https://yourname.github.io
# BASE_PATH=/ai-tech-blog

# Never commit real secrets. This project is a static site and needs none.
